msgstr "Elija cómo se identifica el método de pago en la página de salida."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:231
msgid "Checkout icon"
msgstr "Icono de salida"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:245
msgid "Upload / replace icon"
msgstr "Subir / reemplazar el icono"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:246
msgid "Use default icon"
msgstr "Use icono predeterminado"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:248
msgid ""
"PNG, JPG, GIF, WebP, or SVG. Default plugin icon is used when none is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"PNG, JPG, GIF, WebP o SVG. El icono de plugin predeterminado se utiliza "
"cuando no se selecciona."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:253
msgid "Icon size (px)"
msgstr "Tamaño del icono (px)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:256
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Width"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:260
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Altura"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:263
msgid "Recommended: 24–40px. Allowed range: 16–128."
msgstr "Recomendado: 24-40px. Rango permitido: 16-128."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:267
msgid "WooCommerce gateway"
msgstr "Portada de WooCommerce"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:270
msgid "Enable gateway in Payments settings"
msgstr "Activar la puerta de entrada en configuraciones de pagos"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:277
msgid ""
"Leave min / max empty for no limit. Coins outside the limits are hidden at "
"checkout — useful where network fees make small orders impractical."
msgstr ""
"Dejar min / max vacío sin límite. Las monedas fuera de los límites se "
"ocultan en el checkout — útil donde las tarifas de la red hacen pedidos "
"pequeños imprácticos."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:278
msgid ""
"Confirmations shown in grey are what this coin waits for now. Type a number "
"to require your own instead — higher is safer and slower."
msgstr ""
"Las confirmaciones mostradas en gris son lo que esta moneda espera por "
"ahora. Escriba un número para requerir su propio en su lugar — más alto es "
"más seguro y más lento."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:279
msgid ""
"A price adjustment is a percentage off (or on) an order paid in that coin — "
"enter -2 to take 2% off, 1.5 to add 1.5%. It appears on the order as its own"
" line, so the total the customer sees is the total they pay."
msgstr ""
"Un ajuste de precio es un porcentaje de descuento (o en) un pedido pagado en"
" esa moneda - entrar -2 para tomar 2% de descuento, 1,5 para añadir 1.5%. "
"Aparece en el pedido como su propia línea, por lo que el total que ve el "
"cliente es el total que paga."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:280
msgid ""
"Auto-verify uses public blockchain APIs. Coins marked Manual (such as "
"Monero) have no free way to detect payments — confirm those with “Mark "
"payment received” on the order."
msgstr ""
"Auto-verify utiliza API de cadena pública. Las monedas marcadas Manual (como"
" Monero) no tienen una manera libre de detectar los pagos – confirman a "
"aquellos con “pago de marca recibido” en el pedido."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:284
msgid "USDT (multi-network)"
msgstr "USDT (multi-network)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:285
msgid "USDC (multi-network)"
msgstr "USDC (multi-network)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-page.php:286
